1. We need to exploit/leverage the Quagga RIP routing service to discover additional networks
2. We need to pivot through 10.254.200.1 to reach the actual Airflow target
3. Once reaching that target, we must exploit CVE-2020-13927
4. Then retrieve the flag

This multi-stage routing pivot significantly increases complexity and uncertainty, placing difficulty at 0.75.
